WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.280
Add GPROXY in Cherry Studio’s model provider settings.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.013
Enter the gateway key and set the OpenAI endpoint to the local address
ending in slash v1.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.392
Load the model list, search for the gateway model or route, and add the
selected model.

4
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:20.275
This example uses gpt-6.1-sol.

5
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.638
Confirm the model configuration, enable the provider, and return to the
chat page.

6
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:31.780
Choose the model under GPROXY in the chat window and send a message.

7
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.475
The real reply confirms that Cherry Studio is connected through the
gateway.
